# Round 5, rule B at a warm prompt (the 08:14 incident): a run ends at ~155K, pi restarts, a prompt 60 s later finds the cache warm and
# no summary prepared (the bridge types no key). 0.3.0 makes the user wait for the warm run plan's summary (A3 at req 14); rule B
# sends the request unchanged and writes the summary in the background.
world explicit known ttl=300 true=300 survival=none c=1 sys=3000 window=200000 native interactive
prompt
say 150K
prompt +1h
call npm 100
call npm 100
call npm 100
call npm 100
call npm 100
call npm 100
call npm 100
call npm 100
call npm 100
call npm 100
call npm 100
call npm 100
say 100
restart
prompt +60s
say 100
